                 formula="time with CC64 ≥ 64 / (first note onset to last note end). Following the MIDI convention, 63 or less is up and 64 or more is down. The share with any depth (CC64 > 0, half-pedalling included) is kept in the table too. Computed per ASAP file; pieces cut from one recording are then merged into that recording by summing pedal time and length (1.4). Medians by composer are over recordings.",
